<title>USA: Consorcio G Grupo Dina names CFO.</title>
<headline>Consorcio G Grupo Dina names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consorcio G Grupo Dina SA de CV said on Wednesday that it named Juan Jaime Petersen the new chief financial officer for the company's operations in Mexico, Canada, Argentina, and the United States.</p>
<p>Petersen was previously employed by a financial consulting firm where he was in charge of corporate finance and debt restructuring for several Mexican companies.</p>
